%20need%20separate%20interpretations%20%28reason%20%27%2Bcode%2B%27%29%27%3B%0Aconst%20refusals%3D%5B%0A%20%7Bname%3A%27self%20references%20retain%20a%20parameter%20initialization%20obligation%27%2Csource%3A%27function%20f%28%5Bfirst%3Dfirst%5D%29%7Breturn%20first%3B%7D%27%2Ckind%3A%27unsupported%27%2Creason%3A%27array%20formal%20default%20reading%20parameter%20first%3A%20the%20current%20default%20profile%20requires%20a%20closed%20parameter%20initialization%20environment%27%7D%2C%0A%20%7Bname%3A%27later%20parameters%20retain%20their%20temporal%20initialization%20obligation%27%2Csource%3A%27function%20f%28%5Bfirst%3Dsecond%5D%2Csecond%29%7Breturn%20first%3B%7D%27%2Ckind%3A%27unsupported%27%2Creason%3A%27array%20formal%20default%20reading%20parameter%20second%3A%20the%20current%20default%20profile%20requires%20a%20closed%20parameter%20initialization%20environment%27%7D%2C%0A%20%7Bname%3A%27later%20bindings%20within%20a%20pattern%20retain%20their%20temporal%20obligation%27%2Csource%3A%27function%20f%28%5Bfirst%3Dsecond%2Csecond%3D3%5D%29%7Breturn%20first%3B%7D%27%2Ckind%3A%27unsupported%27%2Creason%3A%27array%20formal%20default%20reading%20parameter%20second%3A%20the%20current%20default%20profile%20requires%20a%20closed%20parameter%20initialization%20environment%27%7D%2C%0A%20%7Bname%3A%27initializers%20cannot%20silently%20write%20earlier%20parameter%20bindings%27%2Csource%3A%27function%20f%28%5Bfirst%3D3%2Csecond%3D%28first%3D4%29%5D%29%7Breturn%20second%3B%7D%27%2Ckind%3A%27unsupported%27%2Creason%3A%27array%20formal%20default%20assigning%20parameter%20first%3A%20writes%20during%20parameter%20initialization%20need%20their%20shared%20environment%20interpretation%27%7D%2C%0A%20%7Bname%3A%27nested%20patterns%20retain%20their%20independent%20iterator%20obligation%27%2Csource%3A%27function%20f%28%5B%5Bfirst%5D%5D%29%7Breturn%20first%3B%7Dconsole.log%28f%28%5B%5B3%5D%5D%29%29%3B%27%2Ckind%3A%27unsupported%27%2Creason%3Areason%282%29%7D%2C%0A%20%7Bname%3A%27mixed%20object%2